{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1463779-tiers-chart","id":1463779,"title":"Tiers Chart","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-13T20:42:35-07:00","id":1463779,"title":"Tiers Chart","content":"I remember there being a chart which listed the Tier levels and which spats would be of which Tier in one of the Trinity Continuum Core beta versions. I know they removed it at some point in the process (for reasons), but does anyone happen to still have this chart? <br /> <br /> I would just like to see it. I feel like I'm crazy and misremembering it. And I got rid of the drafts at some point....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T20:53:45-07:00","id":1463780,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s on page 71 of the Core rulebook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T20:57:30-07:00","id":1463781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1463779-tiers-chart?p=1463780#post1463780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s on page 71 of the Core rulebook.</div> </div> </div> </div>No. This is what that chart became. But the original chart listed the levels, not just the splat and the target difficulty. Something like:<br /> Tier 1<br /> Mortals<br /> Tier 2<br /> Psions talents<br /> Tier 3<br /> Etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T21:04:46-07:00","id":1463783,"title":"","content":"The original chart dropped numbered tiers because it added nothing and just led to people getting it confused with Scale. An early draft also had Aberrants using target number 6, but since \u2018Aberrant\u2019 didn\u2019t really mean anything either it was dropped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-13T21:05:38-07:00","id":1463784,"title":"","content":"Yes I know they does it. I just wanted to see it if someone still had an image of it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-14T01:02:23-07:00","id":1463806,"title":"","content":"No image now. But it was basically 1 for mortals, 2 for everything except Proxy and Novas, 3 for Proxy and Novas and 4 for Aberrants.<br /> <br /> I am partially tankful it was removed, but it would be easier to just say Tier 3 character as an official term instead of \u201cNova equivalent tier character\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank"